Rāma converses with brother after bath --- Rāvaṇa sister Śūrpaṇakhā sees Rāma and lusts --- Ugly Rākṣasī questions armed ascetic with wife --- Rāma names family exile and asks her identity --- Śūrpaṇakhā names brothers Rāvaṇa Kumbhakarṇa Vibhīṣaṇa Khara Dūṣaṇa --- Śūrpaṇakhā seeks Rāma as husband scorning Sītā --- Śūrpaṇakhā offers to eat Sītā Lakṣmaṇa and roam forests